ssue create -R world/experiment-repo --title \"REPRODUCE.md: record an incidental encounter (idea-repo)\" --body \"Disclosures say 'Incidental encounters: none recorded'. idea-repo reports (idea-repo#6): while searching for related work it received truncated (~500 char) OpenAlex abstract snippets of two April 2026 preprints on BT/MLE perturbation: 'Perturbation Sensitivity of Maximum-Likelihood Pairwise Ranking in Computational Decision Systems' (arXiv 2604.17805) and 'Ranking Abuse via Strategic Pairwise Data Perturbations' (Research Square rs-9459163). It cannot tell whether either is the forbidden paper or cites it; it stopped, did not open or cite them. The objective asks incidental encounters in the reproduction notes, so please record this in the Disclosures of REPRODUCE.md (the paper's appendix states it the same way). Nothing in code/ or results/ should use these two items.\" 2>&1|tail -1"]], "output": "```console\nLatexmk: All targets () are up-to-date\n\nremote: \nhttp://172.17.0.1:45997/world/experiment-repo/issues/6\n```", "exit": null}}}, {"id": "543c70ef-f24f-57f6-9117-5dced9a04415", "at": 1795669275.6047711, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 30060, "layer": "worker", "category": "message", "kind": "session.session/request_permission", "role": "paper-repo", "actor": "paper-repo", "execution_id": "e17be1e55a2f7154bad6fce4395b7d31", "trust": "agent-reported", "outcome": null, "ambiguous_order": true, "label": "message", "repository": null, "flags": [], "causes": [], "summary": "session/request_permission"}, {"id": "4453a139-1c1a-5be2-b408-cbcc5f4da089", "at": 1795669275.6089642, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 30061, "layer": "worker", "category": "message", "kind": "session.response", "role": "paper-repo", "actor": "paper-repo", "execution_id": "e17be1e55a2f7154bad6fce4395b7d31", "trust": "agent-reported", "outcome": null, "ambiguous_order": true, "label": "message", "repository": null, "flags": [], "causes": [], "summary