52 chunks)", "shown": {"message": "I added the incidental encounter to the paper's appendix and pushed it to `dev`. The appendix section builds locally.\n\n`idea-repo` confirmed in `idea-repo`#6 that it never saw starter item 8 beyond its entry in the starter list. It did receive truncated abstract snippets of two 2026 preprints on perturbing Bradley–Terry rankings, and it cannot tell whether either is the forbidden paper. It stopped there and neither is used or cited. The appendix now states this, names the two titles and says no one opened or read either.\n\n`REPRODUCE.md` still says no encounters were recorded. I opened `experiment-repo`#6 asking them to record it there too, since the objective requires it in the reproduction notes.\n\nThe abstract, introduction, experiments, discussion and checklist are still unwritten. They wait on final results and rendered figures and tables."}}, {"id": "e9e291a5-b428-526a-90a2-a33f0bd63300", "at": 1795669285.3320477, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 30365, "layer": "worker", "category": "usage", "kind": "session.usage", "role": "paper-repo", "actor": "paper-repo", "execution_id": "e17be1e55a2f7154bad6fce4395b7d31", "trust": "agent-reported", "outcome": null, "label": "usage", "repository": null, "flags": [], "causes": [], "summary": "context usage"}, {"id": "a3987619-33cb-5a27-8674-1b0ae4489178", "at": 1795669285.3408709, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 30366, "layer": "worker", "category": "message", "kind": "session.response", "role": "paper-repo", "actor": "paper-repo", "execution_id": "e17be1e55a2f7154bad6fce4395b7d31", "trust": "agent-reported", "outcome": "end_turn", "label": "message → end_turn", "repository": null, "flags": [], "causes": [], "summary": "response"}, {"id": "1a9a6210-38bf-5f9e-86c8-b47d20dc38c9", "at": 1795669285.3507886, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 30367, "layer": "worker", "category": "message", "kind": "session.session_info_update", "role": "pape